urce_file":"PROJECT_STATE.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"project_state_precedents","label":"Precedents engine","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"precedents engine","rationale":"Nearest-neighbour matching of today's technical state in the symbol's own history; refuses under about 3 years; presented as described sample never forecast.","source_file":"PROJECT_STATE.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"project_state_research_page","label":"Research page (7 tabs)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"research page (7 tabs)","source_file":"PROJECT_STATE.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_alerts_signals","label":"Alerts and cross-engine signals","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"alerts and cross-engine signals","rationale":"signals.js kinds run on a 15-minute beat with remembered signal_state to avoid re-firing on unchanged findings; PORTFOLIO reserved symbol avoids table rebuild; delivery is in-app only.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_attribution","label":"Attribution (Carino-linked, vs own average)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"attribution (carino-linked, vs own average)","rationale":"Brinson needs benchmark sector weights no free source provides, so decomposes against the portfolio itself; Carino linking makes parts sum to compounded return exactly.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_auto_update","label":"Auto-update (Windows) section","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"auto-update (windows) section","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_briefing","label":"Briefing (materiality ranking)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"briefing (materiality ranking)","rationale":"materiality = 100 x strength x stake x kind weight; reports change not state; read-only; verdict can conclude nothing happened.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_correlation_engine","label":"Correlation engine (date-joined)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"correlation engine (date-joined)","rationale":"Joining on date not position: identical prices correlate 1.0 joined on date but -0.04 by position. Null never 0; average linkage avoids chaining.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_honest_principles","label":"Deliberately honest principles","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"deliberately honest principles","rationale":"Missing data never filled; null rather than guess; beta joined on dates and refuses under 120 bars; precedents are described samples not forecasts; no overall bull/bear verdict.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_importer","label":"Statement importer (preview then apply)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"statement importer (preview then apply)","rationale":"Nothing writes on first call; ambiguous dates block import; pence suspicion raised against stored bars; unknown tickers flagged, never remapped.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_memory_layer","label":"Memory layer (unusual-for-its-own-history)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"memory layer (unusual-for-its-own-history)","rationale":"Levels are free everywhere; the value is whether a move is unusual for that instrument by its own standard, which requires kept history.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_performance_engine","label":"Performance engine (XIRR vs TWR)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"performance engine (xirr vs twr)","rationale":"IRR solved by bisection not Newton-Raphson because a wrong confident IRR is worse than a refused one; gap between money-weighted and time-weighted is the timing effect; no ledger means no MWR.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_portfolio_analysis","label":"Portfolio Analysis (scorecard, attribution, correlation pairs)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"portfolio analysis (scorecard, attribution, correlation pairs)","rationale":"Five scorecard axes reuse the rebuild pipeline's axes so numbers agree; attribution ranks by actual pull on weighted average; pulls sum to zero.","source_file":"README.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null},{"id":"readme_rebuild_pipeline","label":"Rebuild pipeline (what portfolio should exist)","author":null,"captured_at":null,"community":3,"community_name":"Project Docs & Checklists","contributor":null,"file_type":"concept","norm_label":"rebuild pipeline (what portfolio sho